    {
      "text": "this people’s heart is waxed gross, Matt. 13:15 (Acts 28:27). because of the hardness of your hearts … put away your wives, Matt. 19:8. grieved for the hardness of their hearts, Mark 3:5. considered not the miracle … their heart was hardened, Mark 6:52. neither understand? have ye your heart yet hardened, Mark 8:17. upbraided them with their unbelief and hardness of heart, Mark 16:14. blinded their eyes, and hardened their heart, John 12:40. divers were hardened, and believed not, Acts 19:9. thy hardness and impenitent heart treasurest, Rom. 2:5. when Moses is read, the veil is upon their heart, 2 Cor. 3:15. ignorance … because of the blindness of their heart, Eph. 4:18. hardened through the deceitfulness of sin, Heb. 3:13. if ye will hear his voice, harden not your hearts, Heb. 4:7.",
